Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((打开这扇门的人 将获得全新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那人将作为代价 失去最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）我最重要东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈… 又是那个梦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟到 迟到！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）桌子 3点开始的直播 帮我空出一整面哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉能写出好报道。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里姐！ 你就不能叫我起来吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上 要忙新闻直播嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了初中就自己起床。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我出门了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）啊 游马 早饭吃了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事无所谓啦 迟到 迟到！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干嘛啊 奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早饭 是一天活力的源泉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不吃可不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了…我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到教室一决胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭你那肚子，赢不了我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:01:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.38,0:02:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫 打扫 打扫…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手，你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.31,0:02:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垃圾 垃圾 垃圾…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡组才不是垃圾。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}废物 废物 废物…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是什么废卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菜鸟 菜鸟 菜鸟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙 是故意的吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 小鸟 那个 是游马吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）这 这个嘛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《真是的 明明就是个笨蛋》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）不可能不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跳箱20段什么的 肯定不可能啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种高度 我就飞给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啦…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈 蠢死了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能不可能 怎么可能做得到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这种距离连气都不用换…》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的～ 真的是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是挑战哦。 一飞 一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽这么说，可你哪样都没做到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟你根本不懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要的是持续一飞冲天。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要不放弃，总有一天或许就能到达。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎么说，我可有这把钥匙呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）那不是说，是当过冒险家的爸爸和妈妈的遗物吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！这把钥匙能打开各种可能性的门！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的有那种力量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，拿着这把钥匙就感觉能一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是一飞冲天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《而我最棒的一飞冲天是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！在玩呢在玩呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要在决斗中成为世界冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 今天要跟谁……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来挑战连败纪录呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！ 真让人提不起劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要一直冲下去 总有一天连败纪录也……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 铁男君的对手是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当相同等级的怪兽有2只以上在场上集齐时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以那些怪兽为素材 将怪兽超量特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的骷髅章鱼和巨齿鲨叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！ 潜航母舰 航空鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤最大的特征就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为素材的怪兽不会送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是变成叠放单位 来支援怪兽超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，一张超量怪兽都没有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之就是超厉害的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，空气鲨！直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男……啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:08:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，按照约定，这家伙我就收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算把铁男的卡组怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？你是谁啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是九十九游马。这家伙的同学。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你，应该知道这位大人是谁吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，当然知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这学校头号的问题人物，鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真敢说啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这是正当的报酬。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们赌上了彼此的卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要做那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这帮家伙找我麻烦，说我没资格自称决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，那我就用决斗打倒这家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把卡组夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼先生可是参加过全国大赛的水平啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是你们能赢的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事谁知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是以决斗冠军为目标的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗冠军？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道决斗冠军到底有多厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个我倒是不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.85,0:09:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就别这么轻易地把这话挂在嘴边！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做、做梦是我的自由吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做梦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要回这副卡组的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把你最重要的东西交出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最重要东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来这东西对你来说相当重要啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不要我来告诉你这家伙真正的价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要的东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去之后才会明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它真正的价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋竟敢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你最重要的东西已经被毁掉，现在彻底消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾，这副卡组我可不能还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太卑鄙了，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，我给你一个机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是敢说自己会成为未来的决斗冠军，那就用决斗来分胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了我，这副卡组就还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果我赢了，你的卡组就归我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这周日。地点是站前广场。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想拿回卡组的话，就到那儿来，啊哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（（打开这扇门的人将获得新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，那个人将作为代价，失去最重要的东西））
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话，已经。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，今天不挑战第20段吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！不一飞冲天吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来，打起精神来啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，完全提不起劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钥匙坏了之后，居然这么飞不起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，明天的决斗你打算去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，算是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别去。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你赢不了的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连赢我一场都做不到的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能赢得了鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，本来就是我害的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想欠人情。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别误会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是为了你才去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:11:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要的东西在我眼前被毁掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能就这样退缩。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}换成老爸老妈的话，绝对不会逃。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是为了我自己而战！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……随你便吧。这个，给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……帮我找过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！只是碰巧找到的而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡，该怎么用啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个卡组是老爸用过的卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我能好好运用它，一定会很强的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我出门了！游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么？奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿着！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带上吧。饿着肚子可没法打仗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）没被吓破胆这一点 我倒是可以夸夸你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你夹着尾巴逃跑的话 至少还能保住你的卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果要从你这种家伙面前逃跑的话 那还不如别当决斗者了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《只能上了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标 锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[喇叭]AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我手牌里 最强的怪兽是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刷拉拉骑士 召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻的话 第一个回合 是不能攻击的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就 这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 攻击力 1600的卡 就是最强的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤大嘴鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 1800！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兹巴巴骑士的攻击力是 1600。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大嘴鲨是 1800。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.45,0:14:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击表示之间进行战斗的话，攻击力低的一方会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并受到数值差的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比兹巴巴骑士更强的怪兽，在你的手牌里吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种程度的杂鱼，就该守备表示放出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过嘛，就算你有更强的怪兽，也是毫无意义的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 水之喷射！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到这个回合的结束阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽的攻击力提升 1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是鲨鱼先生的魔法连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进入战斗。上吧，大嘴鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大嘴咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（兹巴巴骑士）兹巴巴剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兹巴巴！唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过是生命值被削了 1200点而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 我我我魔术师……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）什么？ 攻击力1500 还攻击表示？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼…… 真是天大的失误啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:16:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌 将神奇魔杖 装备给我我我魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了神奇魔杖的怪兽 攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力低的话 那我就用装备魔法来强化！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！ 这样一来就超过大嘴鲨的攻击力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 我我我魔术师。 攻击大嘴鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然对我的盖牌 完全不警戒啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）宙斯之息！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在 对方怪兽 攻击过来时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效那次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 自己场上有 水属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家 800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的大嘴鲨是 水属性怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 你就接下 这800点伤害吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……是盖牌吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张盖牌，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……盖牌分为魔法和陷阱两种。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能说出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！振作一点！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤骷髅章鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力600……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，那家伙的场上没有比我场上的我我我魔术师{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力更高的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有那么顺利啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动骷髅章鱼的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骷髅章鱼在召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以破坏对方场上表侧表示的一张魔法、陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏神奇魔杖。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，我我我魔术师的攻击力就低于巨齿鲨了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，鲨鱼的怪兽就凑齐2只了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个布阵，和我跟他决斗的时候一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是打算超量召唤吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……果然，靠游马是赢不了的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？就凭这种烂水平{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还真想当决斗冠军吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔……不行，果然钥匙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钥匙坏了，所以完全燃不起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是钥匙没坏的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是因为你还依赖那种东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才赢不了决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想到个好主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是我把你的卡组抢过来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那钥匙也一样，我就在你眼前撕碎扔掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，你就是个自己什么都做不到的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！我才不是那种人！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管失败多少次，不管被嘲笑多少次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止，我之所以能一直一飞冲天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为我一直相信着自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的一飞冲天还没有……还没有结束！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……钥匙……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}≪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，打开门吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这里是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}≪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打开门吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}≪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如此一来，你就能获得新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}≪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是作为代价，你将失去最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我——！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛痛……哎？什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么？刚才的……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦？啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？力量涌上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜噢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.）来吧，呼唤我。呼唤 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜噢噢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级3的大颚鲨和骷髅章鱼叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！No.17 修正龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不是我那时候呼唤的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道。No.什么的听都没听过……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修正龙的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次，通过使用叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修正龙的攻击力上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，修正龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶毒洪流！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来胜负已定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一击就解决你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……好痛……。可恶！果然靠我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁……。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.95,0:22:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.02,0:23:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.73,0:23:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:24:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.82,0:24:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.51,0:24:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.91,0:24:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.40,0:24:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血的战斗果然少不了强力的怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.54,0:24:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下回会有什么样的怪兽登场，真让人期待啊！

